<section class="about">
  <div class="about-content">
    <div class="about-text">
      <span class="about-label">// ABOUT ME</span>

      <h1 id="title">Who am I?</h1>

      <p class="text">
        Hi! I’m Aleix. I am currently pursuing an Advanced Vocational Training
        degree in Multiplatform Application Development (DAM) at Institut Baix
        Camp. Since entering the world of IT, I’ve discovered a passion for the
        entire tech ecosystem—from assembling and optimizing machine hardware to
        structuring the data and applications that run on it.
      </p>

      <p class="text">
        I am particularly motivated by backend development and business logic. I
        enjoy designing and creating databases, optimizing SQL queries, and
        programming in languages like Java. I am also expanding my skillset into
        web development and the creation of robust, efficient applications.
      </p>

      <p class="text">
        My strength lies in technical problem-solving, whether it’s debugging
        code, optimizing a database, or configuring and troubleshooting hardware
        systems at the physical level.
      </p>

      <p class="text">
        Additionally, my previous experience in customer-facing roles has
        equipped me with key skills such as clear communication, empathy, and
        the ability to work effectively in a team under pressure.
      </p>

      <p class="text">My current areas of interest include:</p>

      <div class="skills">
        <span>Software and web application development</span>
        <span>Database design, creation, and optimization (SQL / PL-SQL)</span>
        <span
          >System architecture, hardware assembly, and performance optimization</span
        >
      </div>

      <p class="text final-text">
        I am open to connecting with other developers, sharing projects, or
        discussing opportunities to take my first professional steps in the tech
        industry. Let’s talk!
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="about-image">
      <div class="image-wrapper">
        <img src="/images/photo_aleix.jpg" alt="Photo of Aleix" />
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  /* var(--about-...) obtiene los colores definidos en Layout según el tema activo. */
  .about {
    width: 100%;
    padding: 100px 8%;
    box-sizing: border-box;
    background: var(--about-section-background); /* Usa el fondo del tema. */
  }

  .about-content {
    max-width: 1200px;
    margin: 0 auto;

    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: space-between;
    gap: 70px;

    padding: 60px;

    background: var(--about-background); /* Usa el fondo del panel. */
    border: 1px solid var(--about-border); /* Usa el borde del tema. */
    border-radius: 30px;

    backdrop-filter: blur(15px);
    -webkit-backdrop-filter: blur(15px);

    box-shadow:
      0 20px 60px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.25),
      inset 0 1px 0 rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05);
  }

  .about-text {
    flex: 1;
    max-width: 720px;
    text-align: left;
  }

  .about-label {
    display: inline-block;
    margin-bottom: 15px;

    font-family: monospace;
    font-size: 14px;
    letter-spacing: 2px;

    color: #8b5cf6;
  }

  #title {
    margin: 0 0 30px 0;

    font-size: 48px;
    font-weight: 700;
    line-height: 1.1;
  }

  .text {
    margin: 0 0 20px 0;

    font-size: 17px;
    line-height: 1.7;
    font-weight: 400;

    color: var(--about-text); /* Usa el texto del tema. */
  }

  .skills {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 10px;

    margin: 25px 0 30px 0;
  }

  .skills span {
    display: block;

    padding: 10px 15px;

    border-radius: 10px;

    background: var(--about-skill-background); /* Fondo de cada habilidad. */
    border: 1px solid var(--about-skill-border); /* Borde de cada habilidad. */

    color: var(--about-skill-text); /* Texto de cada habilidad. */

    font-size: 14px;
    line-height: 1.5;
  }

  .final-text {
    margin-bottom: 0;
  }

  .about-image {
    flex: 0 0 350px;

    display: flex;
    justify-content: center;
  }

  .image-wrapper {
    position: relative;
    width: 320px;
    height: 320px;
  }

  .image-wrapper::before {
    content: "";

    position: absolute;
    inset: -10px;

    border-radius: 25px;

    background: linear-gradient(135deg, #694ea9, #06b6d4);

    z-index: 0;
    opacity: 0.7;
  }

  .about-image img {
    position: relative;
    z-index: 1;

    width: 100%;
    height: 100%;

    object-fit: cover;

    border-radius: 20px;

    display: block;
  }

  @media (max-width: 900px) {
    .about {
      padding: 70px 5%;
    }

    .about-content {
      flex-direction: column;
      gap: 50px;
      padding: 40px 30px;
    }

    .about-text {
      max-width: 100%;
    }

    #title {
      font-size: 40px;
    }

    .about-image {
      flex: none;
    }

    .image-wrapper {
      width: 280px;
      height: 280px;
    }
  }

  @media (max-width: 500px) {
    .about-content {
      padding: 30px 20px;
      border-radius: 20px;
    }

    #title {
      font-size: 34px;
    }

    .text {
      font-size: 16px;
    }

    .image-wrapper {
      width: 230px;
      height: 230px;
    }
  }
</style>
